# System Block Diagram

This section presents the functional block diagram of the **Fetal Movement Monitoring Wearable**.

The diagram illustrates the main components of the system and their functional relationships, including:

- **Piezoelectric Sensors:** Detection of mechanical signals associated with fetal movements.
- **Signal Conditioning:** Amplification and filtering of the acquired signals.
- **ESP32 Microcontroller:** Analog signal acquisition and processing.
- **Output:** Presentation of the detected movement information.

